[scott@apple.com (scott douglass) writes:]
[] 1.  What does it mean to be stridently aligned?

that you have a good history of killing monsters that are not of your
alignment and refusing to kill those that are of your alignment, when
questioned. it's more or less a default state unless you've been doing
some wild and crazy things.

[] 2.  What good are statues?

they may contain a spellbook. small statues can be used to force chests.
a level full of statues may contain a statue creating monster. beware!

[] 3.  How do you get these named weapons?

by _persistent_ sacrificing to your god. avoid praying in between.
eventually when things are right you'll get a named weapon placed at
your feet.

of course, if you had a wish and knew what you were wishing for, you
could get one that way (but that's a waste of a good wish).

and then there's this legendary lady of the lake who was last seen
residing in a fountain in a dungeon near you. dipping a long sword
into the fountain is rumored to on occasion attract said lady who's
murky hand blesses said weapon thus creating Excalibur.

